T1  - The landscape of IEC 61499 in modern automation: A scoping review of research trends and gaps (2018–2025)
AU  - Bencherki, Zakaria
AU  - Benfriha, Khaled
AU  - Meyrueis, Vincent
AU  - Sava, Alexandre
AU  - Soares, Philippe
